    "details": {
      "cr": 0.25,
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>NORMI CONSCRIPT GUARD — CR 1/4 mook (run several). Normi conscript guarding the staging mine near Dhul Maldur; Korrun Slagledger's shields. No scaleweaving, expendable, knows it.</p><p><strong>Manual — Pack Tactics:</strong> toggle the Pack Tactics effect OFF when no ally is within 5 ft of the target (on by default).</p><p><strong>Manual — Conscript's Divide (morale/RP switch):</strong> overseer watching → fights dutifully, afraid of him. Overseer flees / an ally drops / shown mercy / cornered → morale breaks: roll or RP — may FLEE, SURRENDER, or LOOK AWAY (let a PC slip past). Some are quietly decent.</p><p><strong>Manual:</strong> spear can be thrown (range 20/60).</p>"
      }
    }
  },
